    \  ASW_label: 0.538819  ARI: 0.356114  NMI: 0.622727\n  Graph_conn: 0.724300  kBET: 0.674495  iLISI: 0.271574  cLISI: 0.995560\n  PCR: 0.546726  Cell_cycle: 0.440410\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nRefined Manual Batch-aware Neighbor Graph + UMAP: Starting with raw counts, doing own normalization...\n  Normalizing total counts...\n  Log1p transform...\n  Using batch-aware HVGs (1488 genes)...\n  Computing PCA with 50 components...\n  Finding 3 neighbors within each batch for all cells...\n  Converting to CSR and symmetrizing distance graph...\n  Applying Gaussian kernel weighting and adaptive bandwidth...\n  Trimming graph to top 120 connections per cell...\n  Computing UMAP embedding from the refined graph...\n✓ Refined Manual Batch-aware\
