    | 1242 | 1 | Manual Batch-aware Graph Construction + UMAP | Aethel I | 884 | 0.5190 | 0.305 | 0.231 | 0.222 | 0.431 | 0.743 | 0.606 | 0.635 | 0.984 | 0.270 | 0.763 |

