    \ | 0.220 | 0.506 | 0.720 | 0.623 | 0.547 | 0.985 | 0.272 | 0.706 |\n| 1242 | 1 | Manual Batch-aware Graph Construction + UMAP | Aethel I | 884 | 0.5190 | 0.305 | 0.231 | 0.222 | 0.431 | 0.743 | 0.606 | 0.635 | 0.984 | 0.270 | 0.763 |\n| 1240 | 1 | Scanpy BBKNN UMAP Integration Baseline | Aethel I | 882 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1238 | 1 | Scanpy Graph-based UMAP Integration (Batch-aware Neighbors) | Aethel I | 879 | 0.4691 | 0.317 | 0.029 | 0.241 | 0.633 | 0.717 | 0.627 | 0.330 | 0.993 | 0.026 | 0.778 |\n| 1231 | 1 | Scanpy Combat Integration Baseline | Aethel I | 875 | 0.6008 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.612 |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n| 1 | 1 | BBKNN Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current\
