  The goal with this hybrid is to combine Combat''s strength with my graph on Combat-corrected data, and then build a UMAP embedding. Both the embedding and the graph will be returned, so everything should be evaluated.


  I''m hoping for a high overall score, especially if iLISI jumps up without tanking the other metrics. That would be a win. If iLISI stays low despite the graph, it''s a bigger issue – maybe my graph is the problem or there is some issue in the evaluation.


