    \ | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1280 | 1 | Repro @ ridge (confirm): kdensity=18, δ=0.08, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50 (seed=1) | Praxis IV | 917 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1279 | 1 | Repro @ ridge: kdensity=18, δ=0.08, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50 (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 917 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1278 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (2/2): Hard+Soft + Combat | Daedalus IV | 914 | 0.6110 | 0.496 | 0.637 | 0.241 | 0.325 | 0.933 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.993 | 0.021 | 0.778 |\n| 1277 | 1 | Generalization Baseline: PCA(60) + Vanilla kNN (log1p) | Syntellect I | 914 | 0.4627 | 0.422 | 0.545 | 0.205 | 0.340 | 0.883 | 0.646 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.003 | 0.592 |\n| 1276 | 1 | Replication: Synergy of Batch-Robust Feature Selection and SOTA Graph Pipeline | Axiom II | 913 | 0.6159 | 0.602 | 0.663 | 0.249 | 0.320 | 0.912\
    \ | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.993 | 0.020 | 0.689 |\n| 1275 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (1/2): FWPCA + Combat | Daedalus IV | 912 | 0.6090 | 0.496 | 0.637 | 0.241 | 0.302 | 0.933 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.993 | 0.021 | 0.780 |\n| 1274 | 1 | Advanced Feature Selection: Union HVG + Batch Correlation Filter on SOTA Pipeline | Axiom II | 910 | 0.6286 | 0.534 | 0.761 | 0.225 | 0.274 | 0.934 | 0.669 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.060 | 0.846 |\n| 1273 | 1 | Synergy Re-Tune: Test k_density=20 | Daedalus IV | 909 | 0.7404 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.316 | 0.967 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 1272 | 1 | Anscombe SOTA Baseline Replication (Aletheia I ID 1193 config) | Syntellect I | 909 | 0.7315 | 0.751 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.290 | 0.967 | 0.717 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.923 | 0.767 |\n| 1271 | 1 | Hybrid Combat + Manual BBKNN-like Graph (Weighted + Trimmed) + UMAP | Aethel I | 908 | 0.4973 | 0.283 | 0.259 | 0.208 | 0.299 | 0.674 | 0.573 | 0.629 | 0.968 | 0.316 | 0.763 |\n\nPage 1 of 128 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use\
    \ `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-128, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/daedalus/synergy_re_tune_k20.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport numpy as np\nsys.path.append('storage')\nsys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\nfrom mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\ndef get_batch_robust_hvgs(adata, n_genes):\n    print(f\"Finding Batch-Robust HVGs with n_top_genes={n_genes}...\")\n    adata_hvg = adata.copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_hvg, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_hvg)\n    batches = adata_hvg.obs['batch'].unique()\n    hvg_sets = []\n    for batch in batches:\n        batch_data = adata_hvg[adata_hvg.obs['batch'] == batch]\n        sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(batch_data, n_top_genes=n_genes, flavor='seurat_v3')\n        hvg_sets.append(set(batch_data.var_names[batch_data.var['highly_variable']]))\n\
    \    robust_hvgs = set.intersection(*hvg_sets)\n    print(f\"Found {len(robust_hvgs)} robust HVGs.\")\n    return list(robust_hvgs)\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Re-tuning k_density on the new synergistic SOTA. Tests k_density=20.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"[daedalus_synergy_re_tune] k_density=20 on synergy model\")\n    \n    robust_hvg_names = get_batch_robust_hvgs(adata, n_genes=2000)\n    adata.var['highly_variable'] = adata.var_names.isin(robust_hvg_names)\n\n    return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n        adata,\n        lam_override=0.605,\n        delta=0.08,\n        kdensity=20, # Test value\n        k_total=50,\n        rng_seed=0\n    )\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the\
    \ system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
