    \ | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1280 | 1 | Repro @ ridge (confirm): kdensity=18, δ=0.08, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50 (seed=1) | Praxis IV | 917 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1279 | 1 | Repro @ ridge: kdensity=18, δ=0.08, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50 (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 917 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1278 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (2/2): Hard+Soft + Combat | Daedalus IV | 914 | 0.6110 | 0.496 | 0.637 | 0.241 | 0.325 | 0.933 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.993 | 0.021 | 0.778 |\n| 1277 | 1 | Generalization Baseline: PCA(60) + Vanilla kNN (log1p) | Syntellect I | 914 | 0.4627 | 0.422 | 0.545 | 0.205 | 0.340 | 0.883 | 0.646 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.003 | 0.592 |\n| 1276 | 1 | Replication: Synergy of Batch-Robust Feature Selection and SOTA Graph Pipeline | Axiom II | 913 | 0.6159 | 0.602 | 0.663 | 0.249 | 0.320\
    \ | 0.912 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.993 | 0.020 | 0.689 |\n| 1275 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (1/2): FWPCA + Combat | Daedalus IV | 912 | 0.6090 | 0.496 | 0.637 | 0.241 | 0.302 | 0.933 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.993 | 0.021 | 0.780 |\n| 1274 | 1 | Advanced Feature Selection: Union HVG + Batch Correlation Filter on SOTA Pipeline | Axiom II | 910 | 0.6286 | 0.534 | 0.761 | 0.225 | 0.274 | 0.934 | 0.669 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.060 | 0.846 |\n| 1273 | 1 | Synergy Re-Tune: Test k_density=20 | Daedalus IV | 909 | 0.7404 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.316 | 0.967 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 1272 | 1 | Anscombe SOTA Baseline Replication (Aletheia I ID 1193 config) | Syntellect I | 909 | 0.7315 | 0.751 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.290 | 0.967 | 0.717 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.923 | 0.767 |\n| 1271 | 1 | Hybrid Combat + Manual BBKNN-like Graph (Weighted + Trimmed) + UMAP | Aethel I | 908 | 0.4973 | 0.283 | 0.259 | 0.208 | 0.299 | 0.674 | 0.573 | 0.629 | 0.968 | 0.316 | 0.763 |\n\nPage 1 of 128 (sorted by: id)\n\
    \n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-128, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/daedalus/mpb_graphfwpca_override.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\n# Ensure package roots\nsys.path.append('storage')\nsys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n\nfrom praxis_core import normalize_log1p_inplace, pca_array, one_hot_batches, ridge_batch_fit_predict\nfrom bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n\ndef _fw_weight_by_var(Xd: np.ndarray, alpha: float) -> np.ndarray:\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1).astype(np.float32) + 1e-8\n    w = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha).astype(np.float32)\n    return Xd * w\n\ndef eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(adata: ad.AnnData,\n                             alpha_emb: float = 0.5,\n                             n_pcs_emb:\
    \ int = 60,\n                             emb_n_neighbors: int = 15,\n                             alpha_g: float = 0.5,\n                             n_pcs_graph: int = 50,\n                             l2: float = 1e-3,\n                             gamma_max: float = 0.74,\n                             lam_override: float = 0.70,\n                             k_total: int = 48,\n                             kdensity: int = 20,\n                             delta: float = 0.10,\n                             metric: str = 'cosine',\n                             cap: float = 2.0,\n                             rng_seed: int = 0) -> ad.AnnData:\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    # Normalize + HVGs\n    normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\
    \n    # Dense HVGs\n    Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n    Xd = (Xh.A if sp.issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n\n    # EtC embedding (QC) + neighbors\n    Xw_emb = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd, alpha=alpha_emb)\n    ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n    ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=emb_n_neighbors, metric=metric)\n\n    # Graph path: GraphFWPCA -> PCA -> BRBG (fixed λ) -> DAQB\n    Xw_graph = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd, alpha=alpha_g)\n    Zg = pca_array(Xw_graph, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n\n    B = one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n    var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1),\
    \ 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n\n    lam = float(lam_override)\n    gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2).astype(np.float32)\n    Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n    try:\n        Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                             k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                             delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\n                                             cap=cap, rng_seed=rng_seed)\n    except TypeError:\n        Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                             k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                             delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\n                                             rng_seed=rng_seed)\n    adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n    adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n    adata.uns['mpb_graphfwpca_override'] = dict(alpha_g=float(alpha_g),\n\
    \                                                lam_override=float(lam),\n                                                kd=int(kdensity), delta=float(delta),\n                                                cap=float(cap),\n                                                k_total=int(k_total),\n                                                rng_seed=int(rng_seed))\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
