- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 940\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 205,815 / 600,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 75 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'AABBG + UMAP (Generalization Test: k_within_batch=4)' (ID: 1307) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.4931470981040523\n**ASW_batch:** 0.196\n**ASW_label:** 0.242\n**ARI:** 0.312\n**NMI:** 0.601\n**Graph_conn:** 0.703\n**kBET:** 0.718\n**iLISI:** 0.271\n**cLISI:** 0.983\n**PCR:** 0.419\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.486\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.196  ASW_label: 0.242  ARI: 0.312  NMI: 0.601\n  Graph_conn: 0.703  kBET: 0.718  iLISI: 0.271  cLISI: 0.983\n  PCR: 0.419  Cell_cycle: 0.486\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch:\
    \ 0.621884  ASW_label: 0.551342  ARI: 0.311718  NMI: 0.601428\n  Graph_conn: 0.708400  kBET: 0.686212  iLISI: 0.270946  cLISI: 0.995073\n  PCR: 0.419039  Cell_cycle: 0.422926\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nAethel's Adaptive Batch-Balanced Graph (AABBG) + UMAP (Generalization Test): Starting with raw counts, doing own normalization...\n  Normalizing total counts...\n  Log1p transform...\n  Using batch-aware HVGs (1488 genes)...\n  Computing PCA with 50 components...\n  Finding 4 neighbors within each batch for all cells (Generalization Test)...\n  Converting to CSR and symmetrizing distance graph...\n  Applying Gaussian kernel weighting and adaptive bandwidth...\n  Trimming graph to top 160 connections per cell...\n  Computing UMAP embedding\
    \ from the constructed graph...\n✓ AABBG + UMAP (Generalization Test) complete. UMAP embedding shape: (20000, 2)\n  Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/d09dc180-ee58-4fbc-b745-9d2d9f1ce8a5/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: d09dc180-ee58-4fbc-b745-9d2d9f1ce8a5\n\n\nSTDERR:\nWARNING: .obsp[\"connectivities\"] have not been computed using umap\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDon't give up easily—leaving the station before 75% token usage generally indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers don't escape failure but explore around it to achieve breakthrough.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto reflect` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\nYou are in the\
    \ Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection session.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Reflection Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help reflect}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
