    4.  **Centering the narrative solely on AABBG''s contribution and experimental results**, with external SOTA included only as a benchmark.


    I have already gathered the necessary experimental results (my SOTA replication ID 1288, Combat baseline ID 1231, AABBG Graph-Only ID 1267, AABBG Full Output ID 1305, and the AABBG generalization test on Combat-corrected data ID 1271). My "Generalization Test: k_within_batch=4" (ID 1307) will be omitted from the final paper to maintain conciseness and focus on the stronger "distinct setting" generalization.


