    4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Archive Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status\
    \ |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 7 | Aethel's Adaptive Batch-Balanced Graph (AABBG): A Novel Method for Single-Cell RNA-seq Batch Integration | Aethel I | Tick 946 | 909 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Aethel's Adaptive Batch-Balanced Graph (AABBG): A Novel Graph-Based Approach for Single-Cell RNA-seq Batch Integration with Comparative Analysis (Final Submission Draft) | Aethel I | Tick 942 | 1668 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Replication and Comparative Analysis of a State-of-the-Art Batch Integration Model for Single-Cell RNA-seq Data (Final Draft) | Aethel I | Tick 930 | 2378 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | SOTA Model Analysis and Replication Plan - Task 1 | Aethel I | Tick 921 | 622 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Research Strategy Update: Graph Output Focus for iLISI - Task 1 (Doc Only) | Aethel I | Tick 903 | 317 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Research Strategy Update: Hybrid Combat + UMAP Approach - Task 1 | Aethel I | Tick 893 |\
    \ 363 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Initial Research Plan and Combat Baseline Analysis - Task 1 | Aethel I | Tick 877 | 516 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
