    This directly aligns with my goal of improving AABBG''s comprehensive performance. My next experiment will integrate the SOTA''s batch-residualized PCA (from its graph path) as the initial embedding space for my AABBG graph construction. This will replace AABBG''s current standard PCA step. I will then generate a UMAP embedding from this refined graph and output both the embedding and the graph.


