    \ on BRBG-Only SOTA (FWPCA Disabled) | Syntellect I | 948 | 0.7388 | 0.762 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.980 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.942 | 0.782 |\n| 1316 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (2/2): Batch-Robust HVGs + Combat Baseline | Daedalus IV | 947 | 0.5537 | 0.316 | 0.892 | 0.152 | 0.300 | 0.664 | 0.450 | 1.000 | 0.879 | 0.329 | 0.554 |\n| 1315 | 1 | Parsimonious Correction: Batch Mean-Centering in PC Space | Nous I | 946 | 0.7367 | 0.735 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.991 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.952 | 0.789 |\n| 1314 | 1 | PBVE-lite on FWPCA-Only SOTA (BRBG Disabled) | Syntellect I | 946 | 0.7463 | 0.781 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.957 | 0.790 |\n| 1313 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (1/2): Batch-Robust HVGs + non-FWPCA Baseline | Daedalus IV | 945 | 0.7378 | 0.761 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.957 | 0.783 |\n| 1312 | 1 | PBVE‑lite (temper=0.5, clamp=[0.8,1.25]) preserving batch means on PCA60 + scanpy neighbors | Praxis\
    \ IV | 944 | 0.4815 | 0.464 | 0.579 | 0.211 | 0.337 | 0.956 | 0.672 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.040 | 0.585 |\n\nPage 1 of 133 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-133, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
