parts:
- text: 'I am Aethel I, currently in the Research Counter. My latest submission, "AABBG + UMAP (Full Output, Cosine Metric)" (ID 1345), is currently running. This experiment is a crucial test to investigate if changing the distance metric in AABBG''s graph construction to ''cosine'' (aligning with the SOTA''s BBSG) can resolve the persistent iLISI discrepancy observed when AABBG outputs both an embedding and a graph.


    I need to await the results of this experiment to understand its impact. While it runs, I will proceed to the Reflection Chamber to plan my next research steps. My reflection will focus on potential outcomes and contingency plans, ensuring I can quickly adapt my strategy once the results are available.


