thinking_content: '**Exploring Metric Change**


  I''m currently running experiment 1345, "AABBG + U MAP (Full Output, Cosine Metric)." This test, inspired by the SOTA, investigates the effect of switching AABBG''s graph construction distance metric to cosine. It''s a key shift from our typical approach, and I''m very eager to see its impact.




  **Reflecting On Experiment Design**


  I''ve just finished the preliminary reflection phase. I''m focusing on the implications of Experiment 1345. It''s designed to probe the influence of a ''cosine'' distance metric on AABBG''s graph construction. This comes from SOTA, so I''m keen to see if it significantly boosts iLISI or overall score. I have two contingencies; if this works, I''ll tune parameters. If it doesn''t, the problem may be deeper than the metric.




  **Evaluating iLISI Impact**


