    | 1338 | 1 | FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite temper=0.5, thresh_log=0.10 (kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50, seed=0) | Praxis IV | 960 | 0.7348 | 0.741 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.308 | 0.968 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.963 | 0.789 |

