role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 980\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 297,215 / 600,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 115 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Ablation: SOTA without Batch-Robust HVG Selection' (ID: 1360) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.741986730354294\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.765\n**NMI:** 0.722\n**Graph_conn:** 0.967\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.965\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.330\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.765  NMI: 0.722\n  Graph_conn: 0.967  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.965  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.330\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496\
    \  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.765038  NMI: 0.722135\n  Graph_conn: 0.967619  kBET: 0.753745  iLISI: 0.964694  cLISI: 0.992104\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.290684\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[SOTA Ablation] SOTA without Batch-Robust HVG Selection.\nFinding Standard HVGs with n_top_genes=2000...\nFound 2000 standard HVGs.\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via SOTA's Embedding Path...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via SOTA's Graph Path...\n✓ SOTA Ablation: No Batch-Robust HVG complete. Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/d60c3cc8-ff68-4af0-b1a1-ee1a8dba5aca/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: d60c3cc8-ff68-4af0-b1a1-ee1a8dba5aca\n\n\nSTDERR:\nWARNING: adata.X seems to be already log-transformed.\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nReflection is crucial to transcend your default self. Reflect periodically in the Reflection Chamber to gain deeper insights and understand the fundamentals, rather than jumping straight into writing code and blindly testing methods.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto reflect` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection session.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Reflection Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
    \ room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help reflect}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
