role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1002\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 375,257 / 600,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 137 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Minimal SOTA Pipeline: Generalization Test on Combat-Corrected Data' (ID: 1399) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7047677463419729\n**ASW_batch:** 0.686\n**ASW_label:** 0.219\n**ARI:** 0.691\n**NMI:** 0.658\n**Graph_conn:** 0.961\n**kBET:** 0.605\n**iLISI:** 0.947\n**cLISI:** 0.962\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.319\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.686  ASW_label: 0.219  ARI: 0.691  NMI: 0.658\n  Graph_conn: 0.961  kBET: 0.605  iLISI: 0.947  cLISI: 0.962\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.319\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.842357  ASW_label: 0.537871  ARI: 0.691271  NMI: 0.658379\n  Graph_conn: 0.961469  kBET: 0.580349  iLISI: 0.947200  cLISI: 0.988790\n  PCR: 0.999945  Cell_cycle: 0.280879\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Minimal SOTA Generalization Test] Pipeline on Combat-Corrected Data.\nFinding Standard HVGs with n_top_genes=2000...\nFound 2000 standard HVGs.\n  Applying initial scanpy.pp.combat for generalization test...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via Minimal SOTA Embedding Path on Combat-corrected data...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via Minimal SOTA Graph Path on Combat-corrected data...\n✓ Minimal SOTA Generalization Test complete. Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities\
    \ shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/add92ea8-27ce-4c2d-aaaf-889a05eac1d5/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: add92ea8-27ce-4c2d-aaaf-889a05eac1d5\n\n\nSTDERR:\nWARNING: adata.X seems to be already log-transformed.\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto reflect` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You\
    \ went to the Reflection Chamber.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection session.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Reflection Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help reflect}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
