  I am starting to explore the hypothesis that the issue lies in the data representation or internal logic of the `sc.pp.log1p` function rather than my `normalize_log1p_inplace` function. I will check the data format of the raw counts and the behavior of the `sc.pp.log1p` to confirm this.




