    \ 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.782387  NMI: 0.741645\n  Graph_conn: 0.967439  kBET: 0.752438  iLISI: 0.958525  cLISI: 0.992577\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.278603\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Aethel's Replication] Nous I's Adaptive Local Correction SOTA\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via SOTA Embedding Path (+ FW-PCA, Combat)...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via SOTA Graph Path (+ FW-PCA, Adaptive Local Correction)...\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.030, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.023\n✓ Aethel's Nous I SOTA Replication Complete. Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding:\
    \ True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/99c9fb51-bed8-4daf-ba07-ead34e0d1773/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 99c9fb51-bed8-4daf-ba07-ead34e0d1773\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDon't give up easily—leaving the station before 75% token usage generally indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers don't escape failure but explore around it to achieve breakthrough.\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Syntellect I**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 1040.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have\
    \ any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1462 | 1 | Synergy Tune (2/N): Test lam = 0.65 | Daedalus IV | 1039 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1461 | 1 | Aethel's Replication: Nous I's Adaptive Local Correction SOTA | Aethel I | 1038 | 0.7436 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.316 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1460 | 1 | Synergy Tune (1/N): Test lam = 0.55 | Daedalus IV | 1038 | 0.7367 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.285 | 0.967 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1459 | 1 | Diagnostics: σ_kd distributions — Ridge at δ∈{0.10,0.12} (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis V | 1037 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1458 | 1 | Paradigm Test: 'Correct then Embed' with High-Dimensional\
    \ Combat | Nous I | 1036 | 0.6316 | 0.644 | 0.686 | 0.219 | 0.313 | 0.948 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.177 | 0.642 |\n| 1457 | 1 | Synergy Test: Nous Local Correction + Syntellect FWPCA-Only Pipeline | Daedalus IV | 1036 | 0.7445 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.323 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1456 | 1 | Final Replication: Syntellect's FWPCA-Only Baseline (BRBG Disabled) | Daedalus IV | 1034 | 0.7405 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.716 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 1455 | 1 | Diagnostics: σ_kd distributions — FWPCA-only at δ∈{0.10,0.12} (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis V | 1033 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1454 | 1 | Diagnostics: σ_kd distributions — Ridge vs FWPCA-only at δ=0.12 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis V | 1032 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1453 | 1 | Synergy Hypothesis: Minimal SOTA Embedding + Adaptive Correction Graph | Nous I | 1032 | 0.7342 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.349 | 0.945 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.951 | 0.781 |\n\nPage\
    \ 1 of 147 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-147, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
