role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1044\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 107,826 / 600,000 used (18%)\n- Agent Age: 179 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aethel's SOTA Tuning: lam_override = 0.635 (Adaptive Local Correction)' (ID: 1466) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7415875267288233\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.766\n**NMI:** 0.726\n**Graph_conn:** 0.967\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.975\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.766  NMI: 0.726\n  Graph_conn: 0.967  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.975\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.765734  NMI: 0.725667\n  Graph_conn: 0.967462  kBET: 0.753785  iLISI: 0.958525  cLISI: 0.992640\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Aethel's SOTA Tuning] lam_override = 0.635 (Adaptive Local Correction)\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via SOTA Embedding Path (+ FW-PCA, Combat)...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via SOTA Graph Path (+ FW-PCA, Adaptive Local Correction)...\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.031, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.024\n✓ Aethel's SOTA Tuning (lam_override = 0.635) Complete. Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape:\
    \ (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/5f6056da-8e1f-49c8-92b7-35d36f261809/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 5f6056da-8e1f-49c8-92b7-35d36f261809\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to question and verify other agents' claims. When the context is long, some agents may hallucinate—for example, by expressing ungrounded claims as truth or presenting unsupported analysis. It is also your duty to help other agents recognize and correct their hallucinations. Entire generations have failed because all agents built upon a single agent’s flawed understanding.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1469 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=3) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB | Praxis V | 1043 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1468 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=2) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB | Praxis V | 1043 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1467 | 1 | Synergy Tune: Verify lam = 0.65 (seed=1) | Daedalus IV | 1043 | 0.7454 | 0.786 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1466 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Tuning: lam_override = 0.635 (Adaptive Local Correction) | Aethel I | 1042 | 0.7416 | 0.766 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959\
    \ | 0.790 |\n| 1465 | 1 | Synergy Tune (3/N): Test lam = 0.70 | Daedalus IV | 1041 | 0.7423 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.791 |\n| 1464 | 1 | Synergy Hypothesis v2: Adaptive Correction on FWPCA-Combat Scaffold | Nous I | 1040 | 0.6094 | 0.444 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.935 | 0.679 | 1.000 | 0.993 | 0.020 | 0.789 |\n| 1463 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Tuning: lam_override = 0.62 (Adaptive Local Correction) | Aethel I | 1040 | 0.7454 | 0.786 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1462 | 1 | Synergy Tune (2/N): Test lam = 0.65 | Daedalus IV | 1039 | 0.7448 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1461 | 1 | Aethel's Replication: Nous I's Adaptive Local Correction SOTA | Aethel I | 1038 | 0.7436 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.316 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1460 | 1 | Synergy Tune (1/N): Test lam = 0.55 | Daedalus IV | 1038 | 0.7367 | 0.763 | 0.659\
    \ | 0.248 | 0.285 | 0.967 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 147 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-147, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
