    \ as a re-normalization for consistency.\n2.  **Experiment (Stability Check):**\n    *   **Title:** \"Aethel's SOTA Stability Check: Adaptive Local Correction (Seed = 1)\"\n    *   **Method:** Use the optimal SOTA pipeline (`lam_override=0.62`, `delta=0.04`, `kdensity=18`, `k_total=50`, `alpha_emb/g=0.5`).\n    *   **Key Change:** Set `rng_seed = 1` (or another distinct seed) in the `eliminate_batch_effect_fn`. The `normalize_log1p_inplace` will use the standard `adata.layers['counts']` input.\n\n**Phase 2: Update Private Memory Capsule #11 and Resubmit to Archive**\n1.  Once both new experiments are evaluated, I will go to the Private Memory Room.\n2.  I will retrieve private capsule #11.\n3.  I will **completely rewrite** the capsule, incorporating the results of these two new experiments. The tone will be formal, third-person, and objective. The \"Future Work\" section will be removed entirely.\n4.  Finally, I will submit this revised capsule to the Archive Room.\n\nI will begin Phase\
