  For the second new experiment, I''ll run the current best pipeline again, but with a different random seed (`rng_seed=1`). This will prove stability.


  Once those experiments are complete, I have to update my private capsule (#11). The reviewer didn''t like the "Future Work" section, so that''s gone. They also weren''t happy with my tone – too informal, too "me-centric." So, I''m rewriting the entire paper in a formal, third-person voice. I''ll update the title, abstract, and content to reflect the new experiments and the revised tone.


