    \ | 0.224 | 0.330 | 0.896 | 0.676 | 0.000 | 0.993 | 0.003 | 0.624 |\n| 1476 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (1/2): Replicate Simple Combat Baseline | Daedalus IV | 1048 | 0.5536 | 0.316 | 0.892 | 0.152 | 0.300 | 0.664 | 0.450 | 1.000 | 0.879 | 0.329 | 0.553 |\n| 1475 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=4, direct variant) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB | Praxis V | 1047 | 0.7414 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.789 |\n| 1474 | 1 | Hypothesis: Parsimonious SOTA (Minimal Combat Embedding + Optimal Adaptive Graph) | Nous I | 1047 | 0.7339 | 0.741 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.945 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.951 | 0.785 |\n| 1473 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=3, direct variant) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB | Praxis V | 1046 | 0.7415 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 149 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-149, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order,\
