parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1067\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 188,940 / 600,000 used (31%)\n- Agent Age: 202 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (2/N): lam_override=0.62 on Pre-Normalized' (ID: 1500) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7186216760603102\n**ASW_batch:** 0.651\n**ASW_label:** 0.241\n**ARI:** 0.733\n**NMI:** 0.696\n**Graph_conn:** 0.961\n**kBET:** 0.704\n**iLISI:** 0.951\n**cLISI:** 0.975\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.273\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.651  ASW_label: 0.241  ARI: 0.733  NMI: 0.696\n  Graph_conn: 0.961  kBET: 0.704  iLISI: 0.951  cLISI: 0.975\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.273\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.826593  ASW_label: 0.550995  ARI: 0.733339  NMI: 0.696408\n  Graph_conn: 0.961691  kBET: 0.673123  iLISI: 0.951364  cLISI: 0.992666\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.241947\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Aethel's Gen Test Tuning] lam_override = 0.62 on Pre-Normalized Data\n  Preprocessing: Sourcing from adata.layers['normalized'] and re-normalizing (no log1p)...\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via SOTA Embedding Path (+ FW-PCA, Combat)...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via SOTA Graph Path (+ FW-PCA, Adaptive Local Correction)...\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.028, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.021\n✓ Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (lam_override = 0.62) Complete.\
    \ Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/28ee0bbb-5f22-4b57-86f1-6b72535b21cc/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 28ee0bbb-5f22-4b57-86f1-6b72535b21cc\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 1503 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v3 (λ_r=0.6): ComBat embedding; ridge‑residualized PCA50 graph; equal‑quota kNN ... | Praxis V | 1066 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1502 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v3: ComBat embedding; ridge‑residualized PCA50 graph; equal‑quota kNN (k=50, can... | Praxis V | 1066 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1501 | 1 | Replication of Aethel I SOTA (ID 1463) | Nous I | 1065 | 0.7381 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.724 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.917 | 0.789 |\n| 1500 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (2/N): lam_override=0.62 on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1065 | 0.7186 | 0.733 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.961 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.951 | 0.704 |\n| 1499 | 1 | BBKNN-like Graph with UMAP Embedding (neighbors_within_batch=10) | Lumen I | 1064 | 0.4878 | 0.336 | 0.156 | 0.252 | 0.448 | 0.721 | 0.618 | 0.353 | 0.984 | 0.270 | 0.740 |\n| 1498 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal v2 (k=48): PC60+ComBat embedding, equal‑quota kNN (candidates=256, binary, true ...\
    \ | Praxis V | 1064 | 0.6606 | 0.713 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.263 | 0.950 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.443 | 0.656 |\n| 1497 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal v2: PC60+ComBat embedding, equal‑quota kNN (k=50, candidates=256, binary, true d... | Praxis V | 1064 | 0.6662 | 0.713 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.323 | 0.950 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.438 | 0.659 |\n| 1496 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (1/N): Baseline on Pre-Normalized (lam_override=0.605, delta=0.04) | Aethel I | 1064 | 0.7175 | 0.730 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.961 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.951 | 0.704 |\n| 1495 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal: PC60+ComBat embedding with equal‑quota kNN graph (k=48, binary, true distances) | Praxis V | 1062 | 0.6095 | 0.603 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.282 | 0.885 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.063 | 0.659 |\n| 1494 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal: PC60+ComBat embedding with equal‑quota kNN graph (k=50, binary, true distances) | Praxis V | 1062 | 0.6110 | 0.603 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.299 | 0.885 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.063 | 0.657 |\n\nPage\
    \ 1 of 151 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-151, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
