    | 1504 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v3 (λ_r=0.6, fixed): ComBat embedding; ridge‑residualized PCA50 graph; equal‑quo... | Praxis V | 1067 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

