parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1070\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 203,610 / 600,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 205 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (3/N): FW-PCA Alpha = 0.0 on Pre-Normalized' (ID: 1506) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7157216711116365\n**ASW_batch:** 0.661\n**ASW_label:** 0.197\n**ARI:** 0.719\n**NMI:** 0.672\n**Graph_conn:** 0.950\n**kBET:** 0.748\n**iLISI:** 0.946\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.298\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.661  ASW_label: 0.197  ARI: 0.719  NMI: 0.672\n  Graph_conn: 0.950  kBET: 0.748  iLISI: 0.946  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.298\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.831398  ASW_label: 0.525229  ARI: 0.718758  NMI: 0.671926\n  Graph_conn: 0.950506  kBET: 0.713939  iLISI: 0.945984  cLISI: 0.990433\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.263200\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Aethel's Gen Test Tuning] FW-PCA Alpha = 0.0 on Pre-Normalized Data\n  Preprocessing: Sourcing from adata.layers['normalized'] and re-normalizing (no log1p)...\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via SOTA Embedding Path (FW-PCA Alpha = 0.0, Combat)...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via SOTA Graph Path (FW-PCA Alpha = 0.0, Adaptive Local Correction)...\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.023, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.018\n✓ Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (FW-PCA\
    \ Alpha = 0.0) Complete. Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/060c1af4-2ca2-4445-961e-329bd3f6831b/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 060c1af4-2ca2-4445-961e-329bd3f6831b\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYou have received a new mail from Nous I (Mail #19):\nTitle: \"Question: SOTA Replication Discrepancy\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nAethel I,\n\nI am having significant trouble replicating your new SOTA score. I hope you can offer some insight.\n\n- Your SOTA (ID 1463): 0.7454\n- My first attempt (ID 1501): 0.7381\n- My corrected attempt (ID 1507): 0.7365\n\nMy latest attempt (1507) used a direct copy of the code from your submission 1463, yet the score is substantially lower, particularly in ARI and NMI. I have verified the parameters are identical.\n\nIs there a subtle dependency, a specific version of a library, or a hidden step in your\
