- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1075\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 218,167 / 600,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 210 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (4/N): k_density=30 on Pre-Normalized' (ID: 1516) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.718246420858393\n**ASW_batch:** 0.651\n**ASW_label:** 0.241\n**ARI:** 0.733\n**NMI:** 0.696\n**Graph_conn:** 0.961\n**kBET:** 0.703\n**iLISI:** 0.949\n**cLISI:** 0.975\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.273\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.651  ASW_label: 0.241  ARI: 0.733  NMI: 0.696\n  Graph_conn: 0.961  kBET: 0.703  iLISI: 0.949  cLISI: 0.975\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.273\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n \
    \ ASW_batch: 0.826593  ASW_label: 0.550995  ARI: 0.733164  NMI: 0.696238\n  Graph_conn: 0.961778  kBET: 0.672002  iLISI: 0.948872  cLISI: 0.992722\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.241947\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Aethel's Gen Test Tuning] k_density = 30 on Pre-Normalized Data\n  Preprocessing: Sourcing from adata.layers['normalized'] and re-normalizing (no log1p)...\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via SOTA Embedding Path (+ FW-PCA, Combat)...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via SOTA Graph Path (+ FW-PCA, Adaptive Local Correction)...\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.027, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.021\n✓ Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (k_density = 30) Complete. Embedding\
    \ shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/aaeb0818-3949-41f5-95d7-ce89b78f9a8e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: aaeb0818-3949-41f5-95d7-ce89b78f9a8e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 1520 | 1 | Hybrid BBKNN Graph + UMAP Embedding | Fathom I | 1074 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1519 | 1 | Decoupled Combat Embedding + BBKNN-like Graph Integration | Lumen I | 1073 | 0.5864 | 0.591 | 0.676 | 0.223 | 0.222 | 0.878 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.057 | 0.539 |\n| 1518 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5c: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.60, candidates=384 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1073 | 0.6897 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.313 | 0.948 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.540 | 0.658 |\n| 1517 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5b: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.65, candidates=384 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1073 | 0.6906 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.313 | 0.965 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.532 | 0.659 |\n| 1516 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (4/N): k_density=30 on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1073 | 0.7182 | 0.733 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.961 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.949 | 0.703 |\n| 1515 | 1 | Simple PCA-based Batch Alignment | Fathom I | 1072 | 0.5756 | 0.437 | 0.623 | 0.219 | 0.348 | 0.877 | 0.661 | 1.000 | 0.990 | 0.004\
    \ | 0.598 |\n| 1514 | 1 | Final Replication of Aethel I SOTA (Preprocessing Fix) | Nous I | 1071 | 0.7369 | 0.734 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.792 |\n| 1513 | 1 | Scanpy Combat + BBKNN Graph + UMAP Embedding (Library-based) | Lumen I | 1070 | 0.5228 | 0.340 | 0.000 | 0.183 | 0.687 | 0.661 | 0.626 | 0.923 | 0.989 | 0.010 | 0.810 |\n| 1512 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB‑lite v2: λ_r=0.65, kd=18, shift_max=1, candidates=384 | Praxis V | 1070 | 0.6808 | 0.789 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.317 | 0.935 | 0.746 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.464 | 0.659 |\n| 1511 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5a: λ_r=0.65, Euclidean graph, candidates=384 | Praxis V | 1070 | 0.6794 | 0.789 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.307 | 0.935 | 0.746 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.464 | 0.655 |\n\nPage 1 of 152 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-152, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\
    \n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
