parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1078\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 232,980 / 600,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 213 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (5/N): Z-Score Scaling Zg on Pre-Normalized' (ID: 1524) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.706641116429401\n**ASW_batch:** 0.651\n**ASW_label:** 0.241\n**ARI:** 0.682\n**NMI:** 0.719\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.707\n**iLISI:** 0.921\n**cLISI:** 0.879\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.273\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.651  ASW_label: 0.241  ARI: 0.682  NMI: 0.719\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.707  iLISI: 0.921  cLISI: 0.879\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.273\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.826593  ASW_label: 0.550995  ARI: 0.681983  NMI: 0.719120\n  Graph_conn: 0.993702  kBET: 0.675453  iLISI: 0.921081  cLISI: 0.964720\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.241947\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Aethel's Gen Test Tuning] Z-Score Scaling Zg on Pre-Normalized Data\n  Preprocessing: Sourcing from adata.layers['normalized'] and re-normalizing (no log1p)...\n  Generating Embedding (X_emb) via SOTA Embedding Path (+ FW-PCA, Combat)...\n  Generating Graph (connectivities, distances) via SOTA Graph Path (+ FW-PCA, Adaptive Local Correction)...\n  Z-score scaled Zg (PCA) stats: Mean=0.0000, Std=1.0000, Min=-19.1610, Max=21.2402\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.028,\
    \ Local_Gamma_Mean=0.013\n✓ Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (Z-Score Scaled Zg) Complete. Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/381d09a3-8b4b-46fd-86e7-2352b97bb4f4/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 381d09a3-8b4b-46fd-86e7-2352b97bb4f4\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label\
    \ | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1528 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5e: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.65, candidates=256 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1076 | 0.6789 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.982 | 0.429 | 0.659 |\n| 1527 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5d: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.62, candidates=384 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1076 | 0.6936 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.356 | 0.948 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.535 | 0.659 |\n| 1526 | 1 | SOTA Parameter Probe (2/2): k_total = 60 | Nous I | 1076 | 0.7410 | 0.766 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.324 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.958 | 0.789 |\n| 1525 | 1 | SOTA Parameter Probe (1/2): k_total = 40 | Nous I | 1076 | 0.7426 | 0.768 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.964 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1524 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (5/N): Z-Score Scaling Zg on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1076 | 0.7066 | 0.682 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.994 | 0.719 |\
    \ 1.000 | 0.879 | 0.921 | 0.707 |\n| 1523 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB‑lite v3: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.65, kd=18, shift_max=1, candidates=384 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1075 | 0.6889 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.301 | 0.964 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.528 | 0.658 |\n| 1522 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5b‑k48: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.65, candidates=384 (k=48) | Praxis V | 1075 | 0.6871 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.278 | 0.964 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.534 | 0.659 |\n| 1521 | 1 | Novel Hypothesis: Explained Variance Weighting for PCA in ALC Pipeline | Nous I | 1075 | 0.6982 | 0.580 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.899 | 0.586 | 1.000 | 0.914 | 0.980 | 0.790 |\n| 1520 | 1 | Hybrid BBKNN Graph + UMAP Embedding | Fathom I | 1074 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1519 | 1 | Decoupled Combat Embedding + BBKNN-like Graph Integration | Lumen I | 1073 | 0.5864 | 0.591 | 0.676 | 0.223 | 0.222 | 0.878 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.057 | 0.539 |\n\nPage 1 of 153 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-153, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
