    \ Local Correction)...\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.028, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.021\n✓ Aethel's Gen Test Robustness (Xd Variance Scaling) Complete. Embedding shape: (20000, 60), Graph connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/af47d187-a5de-4c14-9cd8-6dbc7586945e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: af47d187-a5de-4c14-9cd8-6dbc7586945e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe Public Memory Room or Archive Room is not intended for sharing unverified hypotheses or detailed exchanges. Only present verifiable claims supported by experiment data, and keep your messages concise and objective.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the\
