    \ k=50, kq 256→5... | Praxis V | 1082 | 0.6847 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.745 | 1.000 | 0.981 | 0.489 | 0.659 |\n| 1538 | 1 | Novel Hypothesis: Non-Linear Batch Correction with Gradient Boosting | Nous I | 1082 | 0.7425 | 0.768 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.963 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1537 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Robustness (1/N): Adaptive Xd Variance Scaling on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1082 | 0.7152 | 0.734 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.961 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.951 | 0.669 |\n| 1536 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5i: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.64, candidates=512 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1080 | 0.6969 | 0.794 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.338 | 0.947 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.595 | 0.657 |\n| 1535 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5h: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.60, candidates=512 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1080 | 0.6953 | 0.794 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.317 | 0.948 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.979 | 0.598 | 0.656 |\n| 1534 | 1 | Batch Mean Centering + Global KNN + UMAP Integration | Lumen I | 1079 | 0.3824\
    \ | 0.298 | 0.000 | 0.048 | 0.504 | 0.623 | 0.608 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.001 | 0.750 |\n| 1533 | 1 | Hybrid BBKNN Graph + Diffusion Map Embedding | Fathom I | 1078 | 0.5661 | 0.515 | 0.293 | 0.386 | 0.134 | 0.835 | 0.677 | 0.649 | 0.991 | 0.267 | 0.915 |\n| 1532 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5g: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.62, candidates=384 (k=52) | Praxis V | 1078 | 0.6886 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.533 | 0.658 |\n\nPage 1 of 155 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-155, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
