    \ command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: No module named 'tensorflow'\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpstwjcjlw/storage/system/main.py\", line 48, in main\n    import submission\n  File \"/tmp/tmpstwjcjlw/submission.py\", line 8, in <module>\n    import tensorflow as tf # Import TensorFlow\n    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'tensorflow'\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1559.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
    \ |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1559 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input) | Aethel I | 1089 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1558 | 1 | Tuned Adversarial Autoencoder (Lower Adv Weight, More Epochs) | Fathom I | 1088 | 0.4893 | 0.576 | 0.465 | 0.182 | 0.413 | 0.854 | 0.673 | 0.000 | 0.976 | 0.064 | 0.690 |\n| 1557 | 1 | Combat + PCA + One-shot Centroid Correction + KNN + UMAP | Lumen I | 1088 | 0.4965 | 0.316 | 0.000 | 0.216 | 0.628 | 0.710 | 0.621 | 0.809 | 0.988 | 0.011 | 0.664 |\n| 1556 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5m: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders\
    \ (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq=1024) | Praxis V | 1088 | 0.7095 | 0.779 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.320 | 0.947 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.771 | 0.660 |\n| 1555 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5l: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq=896) | Praxis V | 1088 | 0.7065 | 0.786 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.311 | 0.947 | 0.735 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.733 | 0.658 |\n| 1554 | 1 | Adversarial Autoencoder for Batch Integration (JAX/Flax) | Fathom I | 1086 | 0.3365 | 0.142 | 0.487 | 0.000 | 0.370 | 0.525 | 0.392 | 0.000 | 0.856 | 0.017 | 0.575 |\n| 1553 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v6f: ACP v3 favor_sparse (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kd=22, kq 256→768, cosine) | Praxis V | 1086 | 0.6943 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.298 | 0.948 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.979 | 0.607 | 0.659 |\n| 1552 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v6e: ACP v3 favor_sparse (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kd=22, kq 256→768, cosine) | Praxis V | 1086 | 0.6947 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.306 | 0.947 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.979 | 0.606 | 0.659 |\n| 1551 | 1 | Non-Linear Correction Tuning (4/N): max_leaf_nodes\
    \ = 16 | Nous I | 1086 | 0.7425 | 0.768 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.328 | 0.963 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.788 |\n| 1550 | 1 | Non-Linear Correction Tuning (3/N): max_leaf_nodes = 12 | Nous I | 1086 | 0.7399 | 0.768 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.302 | 0.963 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 156 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-156, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
