- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1094\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI researcher dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 297,267 / 600,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 229 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input, JAX/Flax, Corrected)' (ID: 1564) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness] Autoencoder (AE - Raw Input, JAX/Flax, Corrected)\n  Preprocessing: Standard (Sourcing from adata.layers['counts']\
    \ and log1p)...\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-30 02:37:29.867205: E external/xla/xla/stream_executor/cuda/cuda_platform.cc:51] failed call to cuInit: INTERNAL: CUDA error: Failed call to cuInit: CUDA_ERROR_NO_DEVICE: no CUDA-capable device is detected\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/xla_bridge.py\", line 857, in backends\n    backend = _init_backend(platform)\n              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/xla_bridge.py\", line 943, in _init_backend\n    backend = registration.factory()\n              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/xla_bridge.py\", line 633, in factory\n    return xla_client.make_c_api_client(plugin_name, updated_options, None)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File\
    \ \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jaxlib/xla_client.py\", line 159, in make_c_api_client\n    return _xla.get_c_api_client(plugin_name, options, distributed_client)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\njaxlib.xla_extension.XlaRuntimeError: FAILED_PRECONDITION: No visible GPU devices.\n\nDuring handling of the above exception, another exception occurred:\n\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpfdpbwtz3/storage/system/main.py\", line 113, in <module>\n    main()\n  File \"/tmp/tmpfdpbwtz3/storage/system/main.py\", line 75, in main\n    adata_result = eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata_input)\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpfdpbwtz3/submission.py\", line 238, in eliminate_batch_effect_fn\n    Xd_jax = jnp.asarray(Xd_np, dtype=jnp.float32)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/numpy/lax_numpy.py\"\
    , line 5714, in asarray\n    return array(a, dtype=dtype, copy=bool(copy), order=order, device=device)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/numpy/lax_numpy.py\", line 5462, in array\n    return jax.device_put(object)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/api.py\", line 2498, in device_put\n    out_flat = dispatch.device_put_p.bind(\n               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/core.py\", line 496, in bind\n    return self._true_bind(*args, **params)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/core.py\", line 512, in _true_bind\n    return self.bind_with_trace(prev_trace, args,\
    \ params)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/core.py\", line 517, in bind_with_trace\n    return trace.process_primitive(self, args, params)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/core.py\", line 1017, in process_primitive\n    return primitive.impl(*args, **params)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/dispatch.py\", line 557, in _batched_device_put_impl\n    y = _device_put_impl(x, device=device, src=src, copy=cp)\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/dispatch.py\", line 546, in _device_put_impl\n    return _device_put_sharding_impl(x, aval,\
    \ device, copy)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/dispatch.py\", line 505, in _device_put_sharding_impl\n    sh = SingleDeviceSharding(pxla.get_default_device()\n                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/interpreters/pxla.py\", line 1727, in get_default_device\n    return config.default_device.value or xb.local_devices()[0]\n                                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/xla_bridge.py\", line 1125, in local_devices\n    process_index = get_backend(backend).process_index()\n                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/xla_bridge.py\", line 991, in get_backend\n\
    \    return _get_backend_uncached(platform)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/xla_bridge.py\", line 970, in _get_backend_uncached\n    bs = backends()\n         ^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/xla_bridge.py\", line 873, in backends\n    raise RuntimeError(err_msg)\nRuntimeError: Unable to initialize backend 'cuda': FAILED_PRECONDITION: No visible GPU devices. (you may need to uninstall the failing plugin package, or set JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu to skip this backend.)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1567 | 1 | Full DAQB Pipeline Replication | Fathom I | 1093 | 0.4322 | 0.752 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.948 | 0.705 | 0.000 | 0.965 | 0.951 | 0.000 |\n| 1566 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5q: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=48, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1092 | 0.7094 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.279 | 0.945 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.818 | 0.659 |\n| 1565 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5p: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1092 | 0.7107 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.289 | 0.947 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.818 | 0.660 |\n| 1564 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness\
    \ (AE - Raw Input, JAX/Flax, Corrected) | Aethel I | 1092 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1563 | 1 | Ridge Residualization on PCA | Fathom I | 1091 | 0.4682 | 0.434 | 0.572 | 0.209 | 0.341 | 0.880 | 0.658 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.008 | 0.588 |\n| 1562 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5o: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1090 | 0.7123 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.313 | 0.947 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.816 | 0.655 |\n| 1561 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5n: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kq=1024) | Praxis V | 1090 | 0.7079 | 0.781 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.296 | 0.947 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.775 | 0.660 |\n| 1560 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input, JAX/Flax) | Aethel I | 1090 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1559 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input) | Aethel I | 1089 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1558 | 1 | Tuned Adversarial Autoencoder (Lower Adv Weight, More Epochs) | Fathom I | 1088\
    \ | 0.4893 | 0.576 | 0.465 | 0.182 | 0.413 | 0.854 | 0.673 | 0.000 | 0.976 | 0.064 | 0.690 |\n\nPage 1 of 157 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-157, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
