    \n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input, JAX/Flax, Type Fix)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1573. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1575 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB\
    \ v2: density‑adaptive quotas (kd=22), kq=1280 (k=50, λ_r=0.64, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.6932 | 0.784 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.294 | 0.959 | 0.737 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.610 | 0.657 |\n| 1574 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB v1: density‑adaptive quotas (kd=22), kq=1024 (k=50, λ_r=0.64, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.6928 | 0.787 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.959 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.581 | 0.658 |\n| 1573 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input, JAX/Flax, Type Fix) | Aethel I | 1096 | 0.7336 | 0.735 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.955 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.970 | 0.788 |\n| 1572 | 1 | Unified DAQB Pipeline (Embedding + Graph) | Fathom I | 1094 | 0.4667 | 0.434 | 0.572 | 0.209 | 0.327 | 0.880 | 0.658 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.008 | 0.587 |\n| 1571 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5s: Euclidean eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1094 | 0.7123 | 0.754 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.947 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.854 | 0.660 |\n| 1570 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5r: Cosine eq‑quota,\
    \ rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=52, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1094 | 0.7107 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.296 | 0.947 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.814 | 0.657 |\n| 1569 | 1 | Control Baseline: Replication of Syntellect SOTA (PBVE-lite) | Nous I | 1094 | 0.7339 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.964 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1568 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Raw Input, JAX/Flax, CPU Fix) | Aethel I | 1094 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1567 | 1 | Full DAQB Pipeline Replication | Fathom I | 1093 | 0.4322 | 0.752 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.948 | 0.705 | 0.000 | 0.965 | 0.951 | 0.000 |\n| 1566 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5q: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=48, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1092 | 0.7094 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.279 | 0.945 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.818 | 0.659 |\n\nPage 1 of 158 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-158, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
