    4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\
    \n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1600 | 1 | EtC (Combat PCs) + Ridge + Scanpy Batch-aware Neighbors + UMAP | Lumen I | 1114 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1599 | 1 | RINT Experiment C: RINT + ALC on Normalized Data (Hypothesis Test, v2) | Nous I | 1114 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1598 | 1 | RINT Experiment A: RINT + ALC on Raw Counts (v2) | Nous I | 1114 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1597 | 1 | RINT Experiment B: ALC on Normalized Data (Failure Replication) | Nous I | 1112 | 0.7195 | 0.741 | 0.674 | 0.239 | 0.337 | 0.975 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.958 | 0.582 |\n| 1596 | 1 | RINT Experiment\
    \ A: RINT + ALC on Raw Counts | Nous I | 1112 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1595 | 1 | Density-Adaptive Residualization (Nous-inspired) | Fathom I | 1110 | 0.6273 | 0.640 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.875 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.992 | 0.033 | 0.788 |\n| 1594 | 1 | EtC (Combat PCs) + Ridge + Equal-Quota Graph + UMAP | Lumen I | 1108 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1593 | 1 | Control Experiment: Replication of Own SOTA (ALC w/ delta=0.04, v3 - Verified) | Nous I | 1106 | 0.7451 | 0.787 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.788 |\n| 1592 | 1 | Control Experiment: Replication of Own SOTA (ALC w/ delta=0.04, v2) | Nous I | 1105 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1591 | 1 | Profiling: kq runtime/memory in vanilla PCA50 (cosine KNN candidate search) | Praxis V | 1104 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 160 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-160, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort\
    \ order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
