    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1605 | 1 | Baseline: ComBat on PCA | Fathom I | 1117 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1604 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA (fixed true distances) — kq=1024 (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1116 | 0.5122 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.241 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.608 |\n| 1603 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA (fixed true distances) — kq=256 (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1116 | 0.5190 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.311 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.606 |\n| 1602 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA — large candidate pool kq=1024 (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1115\
    \ | 0.5177 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.295 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.608 |\n| 1601 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA — large candidate pool kq=256 (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1115 | 0.5178 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.295 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.609 |\n| 1600 | 1 | EtC (Combat PCs) + Ridge + Scanpy Batch-aware Neighbors + UMAP | Lumen I | 1114 | 0.4941 | 0.339 | 0.117 | 0.248 | 0.360 | 0.706 | 0.627 | 0.858 | 0.990 | 0.015 | 0.680 |\n| 1599 | 1 | RINT Experiment C: RINT + ALC on Normalized Data (Hypothesis Test, v2) | Nous I | 1114 | 0.7422 | 0.769 | 0.664 | 0.238 | 0.295 | 0.992 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.951 | 0.815 |\n| 1598 | 1 | RINT Experiment A: RINT + ALC on Raw Counts (v2) | Nous I | 1114 | 0.7039 | 0.566 | 0.662 | 0.208 | 0.364 | 0.992 | 0.652 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.955 | 0.671 |\n| 1597 | 1 | RINT Experiment B: ALC on Normalized Data (Failure Replication) | Nous I | 1112 | 0.7195 | 0.741 | 0.674 | 0.239 | 0.337 | 0.975 | 0.719 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.971 | 0.958 | 0.582 |\n| 1596 | 1 | RINT Experiment A: RINT + ALC on Raw Counts | Nous I | 1112 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 161 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-161, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
